{
  "about": "The Wilderness's levels 21 to 35 on the surface, x 2944 to 3391, z 3680 to 3799 (Wilderness step W3.3): the skeletons of the Bone Yard and the Ruins, the Forgotten Cemetery's Ankou and zombies, the Bandit Camp's north end with its bandits and three champions (21 to 24), the hobgoblins of the Bandit Camp mine (28 to 32), the chaos dwarves, the Black Knights, the rats of the west, the green dragons, black unicorns, spiders and the ents of levels 21 to 23, and the poison spiders south of the Demonic Ruins as far as level 35. Types and tiles are mejrs's data_osrs NPCList_OSRS.json (NPCs seen on live). Left out: the Crazy Archaeologist, Venenatis and Vet'ion (bosses, piece 4), the black chinchompas (Hunter, not built), the fishing spots, Ian, Larry and Neil the cape sellers, Fat Tony and Noterazzo (shops), and the Mysterious ghost. Every wander range is guessed until recorded.",
